## ObjectType: Flexible Device

Local operational object; source concept reference does not assert OWL equivalence.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| device_id | Device id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | device_id |
| site_id | Site id | string | Explicit foreign-key association; blank creates no edge. | site_id |
| name | Name | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | name |
| device_type | Device type | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | device_type |
| device_type_code | Device type code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | device_type_code |
| max_reduction_kw | Max reduction kw | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | max_reduction_kw |
| min_service_kw | Min service kw | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | min_service_kw |
| status | Status | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | status |
| status_code | Status code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | status_code |

